" Adaptive Page Theme
" Place adaptive-theme.js next to this tridactylrc.
" Place theme.css inside a themes folder next to this tridactylrc.

colours adaptive

command adaptive_theme js -r adaptive-theme.js

" Refresh after navigation, tab switches, and same-document navigation.
autocmd DocLoad ^.*$ adaptive_theme
autocmd TabEnter ^.*$ adaptive_theme
autocmd HistoryState ^.*$ adaptive_theme

" The command-line iframe may be created lazily; refresh when it opens.
autocmd ModeEnter ^ex$ adaptive_theme

" Apply immediately when this file is sourced.
adaptive_theme

